WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
Choose a seated or resting position that marks a transition out of the active day.

2
00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:10.600
You do not need to finish every task, settle every thought, or feel calm before evening can begin.

3
00:00:18.116 --> 00:00:21.146
Notice the support beneath the body and the light around you.

4
00:00:22.846 --> 00:00:23.996
Let the eyes soften.

5
00:00:25.696 --> 00:00:28.366
Feel one ordinary exhale without trying to make it long.

6
00:00:44.025 --> 00:00:46.725
Recognize that a portion of the day has passed.

7
00:00:48.425 --> 00:00:54.515
It may have been satisfying, difficult, uneventful, unfinished, or all of these at different times.

8
00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:17.136
Bring to mind three simple facts from the day, without analysis.

9
00:01:18.836 --> 00:01:19.596
A place you were.

10
00:01:21.296 --> 00:01:23.756
A person or task you encountered.

11
00:01:25.456 --> 00:01:26.786
One moment that stands out.

12
00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.668
Let each fact be acknowledged, then set down.

13
00:01:53.368 --> 00:01:58.298
You are not required to decide what the whole day meant.

14
00:02:17.089 --> 00:02:19.119
Notice what the body is still carrying.

15
00:02:20.819 --> 00:02:25.519
Perhaps tension in the eyes, jaw, shoulders, hands, belly, or legs.

16
00:02:27.219 --> 00:02:30.769
Choose one area and allow only the effort that is ready to release.

17
00:02:52.692 --> 00:02:56.732
Press that area gently into support or make a small movement, then stop.

18
00:02:58.432 --> 00:03:00.882
Feel what changes and what remains.

19
00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:04.442
Release is allowed to be partial.

20
00:03:23.232 --> 00:03:26.312
If an unfinished task appears, name it briefly.

21
00:03:28.012 --> 00:03:33.972
Decide whether it requires action tonight, belongs on a later list, or can remain unresolved.

22
00:03:35.672 --> 00:03:37.462
Do not solve it inside the practice.

23
00:03:59.385 --> 00:04:02.885
Try the phrase: not now does not mean never.

24
00:04:04.585 --> 00:04:08.035
Let the mind place one task outside this moment.

25
00:04:29.957 --> 00:04:34.117
If a conversation or mistake returns, recognize that reflection may matter.

26
00:04:35.817 --> 00:04:38.827
For this breath, separate future repair from present replay.

27
00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.500
Feel the back of the body.

28
00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:08.050
Let the chair, bed, floor, or cushion receive more weight.

29
00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:12.660
Notice gravity continuing without your management.

30
00:05:37.714 --> 00:05:40.014
Listen to the evening sounds around you.

31
00:05:41.714 --> 00:05:44.104
Near, far, steady, or changing.

32
00:05:45.804 --> 00:05:48.624
Let the room be larger than the day's internal commentary.

33
00:06:10.546 --> 00:06:12.156
Bring attention to the hands.

34
00:06:13.856 --> 00:06:16.276
Uncurl the fingers if they are holding.

35
00:06:17.976 --> 00:06:20.916
Let the palms rest in a way that asks nothing of them.

36
00:06:39.707 --> 00:06:42.807
Recall one thing you completed or carried far enough for today.

37
00:06:44.507 --> 00:06:45.507
It can be very small.

38
00:06:47.207 --> 00:06:50.277
Mark its stopping point without needing pride or relief.

39
00:07:12.199 --> 00:07:13.849
Recall one thing that remains open.

40
00:07:15.549 --> 00:07:20.479
Say quietly: this is unfinished, and this practice is not the place to finish it.

41
00:07:22.179 --> 00:07:23.509
Feel support again.

42
00:07:48.564 --> 00:07:49.844
Let three breaths pass.

43
00:07:51.544 --> 00:07:54.994
With each exhale, release the demand to summarize the day perfectly.

44
00:07:56.694 --> 00:07:59.404
With each inhale, receive the actual room you are in.

45
00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:32.670
Notice what evening needs next: food, hygiene, contact, quiet, preparation, or sleep.

46
00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:37.160
Choose the next caring step rather than the whole sequence.

47
00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:58.090
Widen attention to the body from head to feet.

48
00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:04.850
There may be tiredness, energy, heaviness, restlessness, or no clear pattern.

49
00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:07.630
Let the body be honest.

50
00:09:26.421 --> 00:09:29.651
Open the gaze and recognize the transition you are making.

51
00:09:31.351 --> 00:09:34.411
The day does not have to be resolved to be set down for now.

52
00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.140
Move slowly toward the next part of the evening.

53
00:09:53.840 --> 00:10:00.000
You practiced release as a boundary in time, not as forgetting or pretending nothing matters.
